<title>FRANCE: Axa H1 net attrib profit 1.98 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Axa H1 net attrib profit 1.98 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   1,977  vs	   1,302</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>    Life insurance				 504  vs	     555</p>
<p>     - Europe					234  vs	     310</p>
<p>     - North America			     199  vs	     293</p>
<p>     - Asia/Pacific				 71  vs	 loss 48</p>
<p>    Non-Life					 610  vs	     320</p>
<p>     - Europe					525  vs	     204</p>
<p>     - North America				85  vs	     112</p>
<p>     - Asia/Pacific				  0  vs		 4</p>
<p>    Re-insurance				   221  vs	     193</p>
<p>    Financial services			   618  vs	     397</p>
<p>     - Europe					123  vs	     116</p>
<p>     - North America			     482  vs	     281</p>
<p>     - Asia/Pacific				 13  vs		-</p>
<p>    Holdings					  24  vs    loss   163</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			 87.5   up 21.2 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - Axa SA gave its results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
